    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Thousands of participants from around the world, including government leaders, policymakers, healthcare professionals, NGO representatives, corporate leaders, and global media outlets, have gathered in Kuala Lumpur from May 28 to May 30 for Women Deliver 2013, the largest global event of the decade to focus on the health and empowerment of women.",
